.. raw:: html

    <div class="sphx-glr-thumbcontainer" tooltip="Sampling the Duffing oscillator&#x27;s state once per drive period (stroboscopically) collapses its effectively-3D state space (position, velocity, and drive phase) back to a 2D picture: a periodic response shows up as one (or a few) fixed points, while chaotic parameters produce a scattered, fractal-looking set of points.">

